{"id": "44", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a man talks, footsteps on dirt are heard amidst buzzing insects and chirping birds, while a beekeeper inspects a frame of bees inside a wooden beehive.", "pred": "\\boxed{A person uses a hive tool to pry apart wooden frames covered in bees and honeycomb inside a wooden beehive while buzzing is audible.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A person uses a hive tool to pry apart wooden frames covered in bees and honeycomb inside a wooden beehive while buzzing is audible.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n\\boxed{A person uses a hive tool to pry apart wooden frames covered in bees and honeycomb inside a wooden beehive while buzzing is audible.}\n\\boxed{A person uses a hive tool to pry apart wooden frames covered in bees and honeycomb inside a wooden beehive while buzzing is audible. The frames are arranged in parallel rows with visible gaps, and the hive sits on a green surface outdoors with dry leaves nearby. The person's hands are visible wearing a grey long-sleeved shirt, manipulating the frames with precision. The sound of bees is continuous and prominent throughout the action.}\n\\boxed{The person continues to pry apart wooden frames covered in bees and honeycomb inside a wooden beehive while buzzing is audible. The frames are arranged in parallel rows with visible gaps, and the hive sits on a green surface outdoors with dry leaves nearby. The person's hands are visible wearing a grey long-sleeved shirt, manipulating the frames with precision. The sound of bees is continuous and prominent throughout the action.}\n\n\\boxed{A person uses a hive tool to pry apart wooden frames covered in bees and honeycomb inside a wooden beehive while buzzing is audible.}", "time_sec": 186.478, "generation_time_seconds": 142.1204, "selection_time_seconds": 40.2447, "nemotron": {"method": "to